re user-friendly in the design.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.95", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.96", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.97", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.98"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "User research shows current remotes have an unattractive look-and-feel, do not match the operating behavior, are often misplaced, and take too long to learn, indicating UX problems.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.42", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.43", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.44", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.45", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.46", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.47", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.48", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.49", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.50", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.51"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The product will support only one device, i.e., a single-device configuration.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.132", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.68", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.81"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "The purpose and scope of the screen feature are unclear and its relation to basic versus advanced functions needs clarification.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.92", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.93", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.94", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.95", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.79"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "proble