ll, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "We will implement a functional display with four cursors.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.115", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.221", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.192", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.222", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.193"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": "we need just the functional display and four cursors", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "The current prototype is bent and doesn't work well.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.204", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.205"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The display should be placed on top.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.252", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.123", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.253", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.125", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.208", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.209", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.126", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.127"], "owner_ids": ["MTD024ME"], "owner_cue": "I mean a screen on top looks more lo logical to me.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The corporate logo should be placed on top of the screen.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.257", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.129", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.258", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.259"], "owner_ids": ["MTD024ME"], "owner_cue": "So we put this on top , and then make the corporate logo", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "A microphone will be included for speech recognition if that feature is implemented.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.202", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.203", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.245", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.246"], "owner_ids": ["MTD024ME"], "owner_cue": "And for the speech uh recognition part , if we want to incorporate that , we need a microphone", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "The microphone placement on top or side risks being blocked by the user's hand.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.261", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.212", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.128"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "Using the remote's functions may cause the user's hand to block the display.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.122", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.124"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "There is uncertainty about placing the display at the bottom versus the top; no final decision yet.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.120", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.249", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.206", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.250", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.252", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.126", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.127"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The group proposed two menus: a button menu for direct access and an LCD/software-driven menu for LCD options that communicates with the infrared